# The shader example in a page: haxe build-web.hxml -> web/app.js, beside web/index.html; serve web/ and open it (?quit_after_frame=60 quits
# after frame 60). helix-platform alone: haxelib dev helix-platform <checkout>/libs/platform first.
-lib helix-platform
-cp .
-main Main
-dce full
-js web/app.js
